:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy units, see [[Hermit Cat (Enemy)]] and [[Masked Grandmaster Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Hermit Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] and can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after beating [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]] increases HP, decreases recharge time, is immune to curse, has a chance to [[Curse|Curse]] [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]], is strong against them, and produces a level 5 [[Wave Attack]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] having the same unlock requirements.

